      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEDROCK PEBBLES (2) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at Angle Park over 530m (30.99). Returns to a course where she has performed well. Tough to beat if on-song. CLASSIC RETRO (1) jumped well from this draw last time and was prominent throughout before holding third (22.78) in a Grade 5 at this track over 395m. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Key chance on best form. ADHANA MARTINA (3) could manage only third at this track last time but impressed when posting a swift 22.80 over 400m at Gawler three starts ago. Smart winner three back and looks a key chance on that form. MISS CHAPO (8) deserves plenty of thought over this journey.",
